{#- Chairs free today: the blow-dry and walk-in slots the salon has put on its sheet for today, soonest first, each with
    who and a WhatsApp message asking for it (never "booked"). Fails closed: an old or unreadable sheet, a slot already
    started or outside today's hours shows nothing, and the box says so. The box keeps its height, so nothing moves. Inside the
    hero (the look lists it in heroParts) it is set on the photograph with a short heading. -#}
{%- set sec = site.sections.chairs %}
<section id="chairs" class="hr-ch{% if chIn %} hr-ch-hero{% endif %}" data-feature="chairs-today" aria-labelledby="ch-h"><div class="wrap hr-ch-in">
  {%- if chIn %}<h2 class="hr-ch-h" id="ch-h">{{ sec.title | plain }}</h2>{% else %}{% set secId = "ch-h" %}{% include "core/partials/section-head.njk" %}{% endif %}
  <div class="hr-ch-box">
    <ol class="hr-ch-list" data-ch-list aria-live="polite"></ol>
    <p class="hr-ch-none" data-ch-none>Ask us on WhatsApp for a chair today. <a class="hr-go" href="{{ site.chairs.message | book }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ask</a></p>
  </div>
  {%- if site.chairs.note and not chIn %}<p class="hr-small hr-ch-note">{{ site.chairs.note }}</p>{% endif %}
  <ul hidden>{% for x in site.stylists.items %}<li data-ch-who="{{ x.id }}" data-name="{{ x.name.split(' ')[0] }}"></li>{% endfor %}</ul>
</div></section>
